#: .\apps\core\templates\core\about.html:3
msgid "About · The Caffeine Lane"
msgstr "Acerca de · The Caffeine Lane"

#: .\apps\core\templates\core\about.html:9
#: .\apps\core\templates\core\contact.html:8
#: .\apps\core\templates\core\home.html:48
#: .\apps\posts\templates\posts\post_detail.html:47 .\templates\base.html:9
#: .\templates\components\footer.html:30
#: .\templates\components\post_card.html:8 .\templates\layouts\auth.html:11
msgid "The Caffeine Lane"
msgstr "The Caffeine Lane"

#: .\apps\core\templates\core\about.html:10
msgid "Built for the ride between the garage and the road."
msgstr "Hecho para el viaje entre el garaje y la ruta."

#: .\apps\core\templates\core\about.html:11
msgid ""
"The Caffeine Lane is an editorial home for the people who keep a machine "
"close, a tool roll nearby, and a better route in mind."
msgstr ""
"The Caffeine Lane es un hogar editorial para quienes mantienen una máquina "
"cerca, un juego de herramientas a mano y una mejor ruta en mente."

#: .\apps\core\templates\core\about.html:20
msgid "The mission"
msgstr "La misión"

#: .\apps\core\templates\core\about.html:21
msgid "Machines carry stories."
msgstr "Las máquinas llevan historias."

#: .\apps\core\templates\core\about.html:24
msgid ""
"We believe a motorcycle is more than transportation. It is a record of "
"choices, hands-on work, wrong turns, and the miles that prove what matters."
msgstr ""
"Creemos que una motocicleta es más que transporte. Es un registro de "
"decisiones, trabajo manual, desvíos y los kilómetros que demuestran lo que "
"importa."

#: .\apps\core\templates\core\about.html:25
msgid ""
"That is why we make room for practical guides, honest reviews, and builds "
"with a point of view — work worth taking from the bench to the open road."
msgstr ""
"Por eso damos lugar a guías prácticas, reseñas honestas y proyectos con "
"punto de vista: trabajo que vale la pena llevar del banco a la ruta abierta."

#: .\apps\core\templates\core\about.html:31
msgid "The Rider working in the garage"
msgstr "The Rider trabajando en el taller"

#: .\apps\core\templates\core\about.html:34
msgid "The garage"
msgstr "El garaje"

#: .\apps\core\templates\core\about.html:35
msgid "Learn it. Tune it. Ride it."
msgstr "Conócela. Ajústala. Rodala."

#: .\apps\core\templates\core\about.html:36
msgid ""
"The garage is where curiosity becomes confidence. We share the thinking "
"behind maintenance and modification, so every rider can understand the "
"machine beneath them."
msgstr ""
"El garaje es donde la curiosidad se vuelve confianza. Compartimos el "
"criterio detrás del mantenimiento y la modificación para que cada rider "
"entienda la máquina que tiene debajo."

#: .\apps\core\templates\core\about.html:37
msgid "Explore the guides"
msgstr "Explorá las guías"

#: .\apps\core\templates\core\about.html:44
msgid "Why we are here"
msgstr "Por qué estamos aquí"

#: .\apps\core\templates\core\about.html:45
msgid "Garage. Road. Community."
msgstr "Garaje. Ruta. Comunidad."

#: .\apps\core\templates\core\about.html:49
msgid "01 · Garage"
msgstr "01 · Taller"

#: .\apps\core\templates\core\about.html:50
msgid "Make it yours."
msgstr "Hacela tuya."

#: .\apps\core\templates\core\about.html:51
msgid ""
"Practical knowledge for hands-on riders, from first checks to long-term "
"builds."
msgstr ""
"Conocimiento práctico para riders que meten mano, desde las primeras "
"revisiones hasta proyectos de largo plazo."

#: .\apps\core\templates\core\about.html:54
msgid "02 · Road"
msgstr "02 · Ruta"

#: .\apps\core\templates\core\about.html:55
msgid "Put it to work."
msgstr "Ponela a trabajar."

#: .\apps\core\templates\core\about.html:56
msgid "Real-world notes on gear, machines, and the rides that connect them."
msgstr ""
"Notas del mundo real sobre equipamiento, máquinas y los viajes que las "
"conectan."

#: .\apps\core\templates\core\about.html:59
msgid "03 · Community"
msgstr "03 · Comunidad"

#: .\apps\core\templates\core\about.html:60
